00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:32.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've come --
The babies that I have --

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:33.906 line:92%
The main babies in my head

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:37.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
