00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:47.620 line:92%
what you look like as a baby

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, you still got a shot
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:51.824 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's a lesson in hope.

00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:54.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's
a really inspiring message

